## 2. Project layout (multi-module Maven)

```
analytics-platform/
├── pom.xml                      # parent: versions, dependencyManagement
├── platform-core/               # pure Java: paging/filter model, TableDefinition, exceptions
├── platform-starrocks/          # Spring JDBC: DataSource, query builder, base repository
├── platform-web/                # Spring Web: error handling, param parsing (shared by services)
├── service-orders/              # deployable Spring Boot app #1
├── service-events/              # deployable Spring Boot app #2
└── service-.../                 # add more: each is ~5 small classes
```

Each `service-*` depends on the three platform libraries. Adding a new service = add a `TableDefinition`, a view record, a row mapper, a repository subclass, a service and a controller.

