## 6. `service-orders` — a concrete service (template for all others)

### StarRocks table (design the table for the access pattern)

```sql
CREATE TABLE dw.fact_orders (
    customer_id  BIGINT        NOT NULL,
    order_time   DATETIME      NOT NULL,
    order_id     BIGINT        NOT NULL,
    status       VARCHAR(16)   NOT NULL,
    amount       DECIMAL(18,2) NOT NULL,
    currency     VARCHAR(3)    NOT NULL
) ENGINE = OLAP
DUPLICATE KEY(customer_id, order_time, order_id)   -- prefix index matches the hot filter + sort
PARTITION BY date_trunc('day', order_time)         -- bounded time range => partition pruning
DISTRIBUTED BY HASH(order_id)
PROPERTIES ("replication_num" = "3");
```

